    "name": "Pixel Fireplace",
    "steam_appid": 2678480,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/6ae2a74b1944e3392ccbe2b325621165.poster.avif?t=1706475861\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/6ae2a74b1944e3392ccbe2b325621165.webm?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/6ae2a74b1944e3392ccbe2b325621165.mp4?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pixel Fireplace is a relaxing, type-controlled simulation. Type commands to strike a match, throw logs onto the crackling fire and watch them burn down to hot coals in real-time (about 25 min per log). Discover commands with the hint system, or just sit back, turn the lights down and enjoy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/fc45ae5f64ba79d2213010a5559b6547.avif?t=1706475861\" width=532 height=162 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hint System</h2>Letters appear gold if they're part of a command word.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/381ea62264ef7bb2eb1496caa9af39d7.poster.avif?t=1706475861\" width=414 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/381ea62264ef7bb2eb1496caa9af39d7.webm?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/381ea62264ef7bb2eb1496caa9af39d7.mp4?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Second Monitor Support</h2>Run Pixel Fireplace on a second monitor while you work. Double-click to switch to windowed mode, then drag the window to another screen and double-click again for fullscreen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/3a243baaed5b5b1db19126494ed4e0bf.avif?t=1706475861\" width=556 height=360 /></span><br><br>Enjoy a relaxing work atmosphere :)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2>1) Type the word <i>FIREPLACE</i> on the title screen to begin.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/5e8fde147df1c73b9fdcfbf6ef2fbb33.poster.avif?t=1706475861\" width=378 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/5e8fde147df1c73b9fdcfbf6ef2fbb33.webm?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/5e8fde147df1c73b9fdcfbf6ef2fbb33.mp4?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>2) Follow the prompts by typing <i>LOG</i> and then <i>MATCH</i>.<br><br>3) Use the hint system described above to discover more commands. Here are a few to get started! <i>MARSHMALLOW</i>, <i>SMORE</i>, <i>HOTDOG</i>, <i>FIRECRACKER</i>, <i>NEWSPAPER</i>, <i>BLUE</i>, <i>SUNSET</i>, <i>WATER</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Quit</h2>1) Press the Esc key or type <i>WATER</i> to exit from the fireplace screen to the title screen.<br><br>2) Press the Esc key at the title screen to quit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/d660a3b9909e090d15f75c03799a6fe0.poster.avif?t=1706475861\" width=266 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/d660a3b9909e090d15f75c03799a6fe0.webm?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/6ae2a74b1944e3392ccbe2b325621165.poster.avif?t=1706475861\" width=586 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/6ae2a74b1944e3392ccbe2b325621165.webm?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/6ae2a74b1944e3392ccbe2b325621165.mp4?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Pixel Fireplace is a relaxing, type-controlled simulation. Type commands to strike a match, throw logs onto the crackling fire and watch them burn down to hot coals in real-time (about 25 min per log). Discover commands with the hint system, or just sit back, turn the lights down and enjoy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/fc45ae5f64ba79d2213010a5559b6547.avif?t=1706475861\" width=532 height=162 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hint System</h2>Letters appear gold if they're part of a command word.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/381ea62264ef7bb2eb1496caa9af39d7.poster.avif?t=1706475861\" width=414 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/381ea62264ef7bb2eb1496caa9af39d7.webm?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/381ea62264ef7bb2eb1496caa9af39d7.mp4?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Second Monitor Support</h2>Run Pixel Fireplace on a second monitor while you work. Double-click to switch to windowed mode, then drag the window to another screen and double-click again for fullscreen.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/3a243baaed5b5b1db19126494ed4e0bf.avif?t=1706475861\" width=556 height=360 /></span><br><br>Enjoy a relaxing work atmosphere :)<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Play</h2>1) Type the word <i>FIREPLACE</i> on the title screen to begin.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/5e8fde147df1c73b9fdcfbf6ef2fbb33.poster.avif?t=1706475861\" width=378 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/5e8fde147df1c73b9fdcfbf6ef2fbb33.webm?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/5e8fde147df1c73b9fdcfbf6ef2fbb33.mp4?t=1706475861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>2) Follow the prompts by typing <i>LOG</i> and then <i>MATCH</i>.<br><br>3) Use the hint system described above to discover more commands. Here are a few to get started! <i>MARSHMALLOW</i>, <i>SMORE</i>, <i>HOTDOG</i>, <i>FIRECRACKER</i>, <i>NEWSPAPER</i>, <i>BLUE</i>, <i>SUNSET</i>, <i>WATER</i><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How to Quit</h2>1) Press the Esc key or type <i>WATER</i> to exit from the fireplace screen to the title screen.<br><br>2) Press the Esc key at the title screen to quit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/d660a3b9909e090d15f75c03799a6fe0.poster.avif?t=1706475861\" width=266 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2678480/extras/d660a3b99